The defect: `nameset::iter` never drops the record it read, so the walk yields the first name again until the cap stops it.

Expected to fail: the unwinding assertion of the walk's loop.

diff --git a/crates/file_system_contract/src/nameset.rs b/crates/file_system_contract/src/nameset.rs
